    "description": "The Parking Reservations History API provides access to historical records of parking reservations made by users. This endpoint allows clients to retrieve detailed lists of past reservations, including relevant information such as dates, locations, and reservation statuses. Commonly used by parking management systems and applications that offer reservation tracking features, this API enables users to analyze their parking habits and manage their reservations effectively. Developers can seamlessly integrate this functionality to enhance user experience within their applications.",
